Z||000000||avengador1||11-02-2001||11:04 AM||||The other day someone was looking for the name of a cleaner/polisher made out of acrylic. I found this stuff called KLASSE that is supposed to be imported from Germany.<BR>I found it at <A HREF="http://www.herringtoncatalog.com" TARGET=_blank>www.herringtoncatalog.com</A>  item #M663 (both kits). There is a all-in-one and a High-Gloss Sealant Glaze. I ordered some and will post how it works.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
